  "entry": "code/README.md",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Scoring how efficiently an industrial park and its enterprises use and reuse water: it computes indicators C1–C10 at three levels (大循环/小循环/点循环, i.e. park-wide, pipeline network, enterprise), blends AHP and CRITIC weights through an alpha setting, ranks enterprises with TOPSIS into four grades (领跑/先进/达标/待改进), and returns JSON or an Excel report. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
